{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v1","id":"overview","title":"Overview","description":"Understand the form runtime, React integration, and optional form builder.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Multi Step Form turns typed step definitions into a shared form store. Use it for\nregistration, checkout, applications, and scheduling workflows where answers must\nsurvive moving between screens."]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["You define data and completion rules. The library supplies independent instances,\nfield updates, subscriptions, persistence, and typed React component factories.\nYour application supplies inputs, layout, navigation, and submission."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"follow-an-answer-through-the-form"},"children":["Follow an answer through the form"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:pre","props":{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>"},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Definition: fields + step metadata + completion rules"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                         ↓ configure()"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Factory:                 createRegistrationForm"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                         ↓ createRegistrationForm()"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Instance:                answers + state + storage + subscriptions"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                         ↓ createComponent()"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Interface:               contact → preferences → review → your server"]}]}]]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Typing in a ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["Field"]}," calls ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["onInputChange"]},". The instance updates the field,\nrecalculates derived state and completion, notifies subscribers, and persists\nwhen storage is enabled. A review subscribes to the same answers without keeping\nanother copy in React state."]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Despite its name, a resolved field's ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["defaultValue"]}," is its ",{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["current answer"]},".\nThe original definition supplies defaults used by resets."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"learn-the-vocabulary"},"children":["Learn the vocabulary"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:table","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Term"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Meaning"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Example"]}]]}]},{"tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Definition"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Steps, fields, metadata, completion rules"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["defineMultiStep